# Aula F108 Pro Mechanical Keyboard Controller & Studio

Open-source, standalone control software developed for the Aula F108 Pro mechanical keyboard; providing backlight modes, custom per-key RGB, key remapping, 240×135 TFT LCD screen image/GIF upload, and hardware RTC clock synchronization.

---

## 🚀 Features

* **20 Different Hardware Lighting Modes**: Color, brightness, animation speed, and direction selection.
* **Per-Key RGB**: Independent coloring of 108 keys, ready-made templates (WASD, Cyberpunk, etc.), and YAML import/export.
* **Key Remapping**: Key swapping, multimedia controls, and mouse actions for the normal layer (`04 11`) and FN layer (`04 27`).
* **240×135 TFT LCD Screen & Animation Studio**: Converts static images (PNG, JPG) or animated GIFs into RGB565 format within a safe 141-frame limit and transfers them to the keyboard.
* **Hardware RTC Clock Synchronization**: One-click synchronization of the computer clock to the keyboard's internal clock (`04 28 Protocol`).
* **HID Packet Inspector**: Live monitoring of all sent and received 64-byte raw USB reports.

